! DIAGNOSTIC: straight-through tilted slab (NO fold, NO reflection).
! Purpose: does CODE V find a chief ray at all with this collimated/decentered input?
!   - traces  -> input setup is FINE; the only problem is the fold sign convention.
!   - fails   -> the object-at-infinity + decentered-stop is the gate; fix that first.
LEN NEW
DIM M
WL 587.56
REF 1
EPD 8.000000
YAN 23.884815
PRV
PWL 587.56
'FOLDN' 1.500000
END
SO 0 1e18
! decentered aperture stop at the source
YDE S1 9.459225
STO S1
THI S1 37.207328
! tilted entry face into glass (same face-A curvature/tilt as 4_11, but NO fold after)
S 156.054833 25.0 'FOLDN'
ADE S2 10.876174
! flat exit face back to air (simple, on-axis)
S 0 40.0
! image / detector
SI 0 0
CIR SI 20.0
GO
